title: API.pm is missing no Moose; before make_immutable
updated: 2026-08-27T04:07:03Z
---

House convention (getty-perl-core): every Moose class ends with "no Moose;"
followed by __PACKAGE__->meta->make_immutable.

lib/Dist/Zilla/Plugin/Docker/API.pm has make_immutable but no "no Moose;". It
does load namespace::autoclean, which cleans the imported sugar, so this is
convention rather than a live bug - but it is the only Moose class in the dist
and should read like one.

Fixed: 'no Moose;' added before make_immutable in API.pm. Also added the missing '=encoding utf8' - the POD failed podchecker before, which would have blocked a release.
